      "description": "Two vertically-stacked print areas (A1:H6 and A9:H14), each spanning wide columns A:H so the columns overflow one A4-portrait page, split by a manual column break before D. Exercises multi-area pagination where each print area is an independent page grid: the shared manual column break splits both areas' columns, symmetric with how a shared manual row break splits two side-by-side areas.",
